# No API key or LLM account is required. This example is NOT loaded automatically.
# Set variables in your shell before running the launcher.
# 1 allows the user's optional Open-Meteo forecast button; 0 disables it.
JEJU_FLOWER_WEATHER_API=1
# Compute selection is set by --semantic-device cpu|auto|dml on Windows.
# Ubuntu uses the local CPU runtime; Windows DLLs are not loaded on Linux.
